• After the “buy plan” decision is made, work with the manufacturing partner to ensure: ○ On time PO acceptance

• On-time Delivery of first PO ex-factory

• Readiness to produce 1st replenishment order

• Readiness of fabric and trims for future growth&nbsp;

Production&nbsp;

